# EAgent environment configuration — copy to `.env` and fill in.
#
# The CLI (`eagent`) and server (`eagent-serve`) auto-load `.env` at startup.
# Values already present in the real environment always take precedence, so
# `.env` is a convenience for local development, not an override.
#
# With no provider key set, EAgent runs the deterministic offline mock.

# --- Anthropic (the default provider when configured) ---------------------
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY or ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN both work (sent as x-api-key).
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=sk-...
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com      # or an Anthropic-compatible proxy
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-fable-5                     # used unless you pass --model

# --- OpenAI / OpenAI-compatible (vLLM, Ollama, GLM gateways, ...) ----------
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o
# OPENAI_MAX_TOKENS_PARAM=max_tokens                 # set max_completion_tokens for newer OpenAI models

# --- Google Gemini --------------------------------------------------------
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...                                 # or GOOGLE_API_KEY
# GEMINI_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash

# --- HTTP server (eagent-serve) -------------------------------------------
# EAGENT_TOKEN=change-me        # require `Authorization: Bearer <token>` on /run & DELETE /sessions
# EAGENT_HOST=127.0.0.1         # bind address; set 0.0.0.0 to expose (only with a token!)
# PORT=8787

# --- Misc -----------------------------------------------------------------
# EAGENT_WORKSPACE=.                                 # root the fs tools are confined to
# EAGENT_JOURNAL=~/.eagent/journal.jsonl             # enable durable run journaling
# EAGENT_MCP_SERVERS=[]                              # JSON array of MCP server configs
